and account creation\n- Navigation between login/signup pages\n- Password field masking\n- Form submission via Enter key\n- Authentication redirects\n\n#### 3. **src/components/LoginForm.tsx** (3.9KB)\n- **State**: email, password, validationErrors, loading/error from Redux\n- **Validation**: Email format and required fields\n- **Features**: Form submission, field-level error display, loading state\n- **Redux Integration**: Uses `useDispatch`, dispatches `login()` and `clearError()`\n- **Styling**: Uses CSS variables (--color-text-primary, --color-accent, etc.)\n\n#### 4. **src/components/SignUpForm.tsx** (5KB)\n- **State**: name, email, password, validationErrors, loading/error from Redux\n- **Validation**: Name, email format, password minimum 8 characters\n- **Features**: Form submission, field-level error display, loading state\n- **Redux Integration**: Uses `useDispatch`, dispatches `signup()` and `clearError()`\n- **Styling**: Consistent with LoginForm using CSS variables\n\n#### 5. **src/pages/Login.tsx** (0.7KB)\n- **Route Redirect**: Redirects authenticated users (/token exists) to /my-issues\n- **Component**: Renders LoginForm inside a centered container\n\n#### 6. **src/pages/SignUp.tsx** (0.7KB)\n- **Route Redirect**: Redirects authenticated users to /my-issues\n- **Component**: Renders SignUpForm inside a centered container\n\n#### 7. **src/slices/authSlice.ts** (3.6KB)\n**Redux slice** with:\n- **State**: user (id, name, email) | null, token | null, loading, error\n- **Async Thunks**:\n  - `login()`: POST /api/login, stores token in localStorage\n  - `signup()`: POST /api/signup, creates default workspace, stores token\n  - `fetchCurrentUser()`: GET /api/me with Bearer token, validates session\n- **Reducers**:\n  - `logout()`: Clears user/token, removes from localStorage\n  - `clearError()`: Clears error messages\n- **Extra Reducers**: Handle all thunk states (pending, fulfilled, rejected)\n\n#### 8. **netlify/functions/db.ts** (0.1KB)\n- **Purpose**: Database connection helper\n- **Uses**: @neondatabase/serverless (Neon Postgres)\n- **Exports**: `getSql()` function that returns SQL client\n\n#### 9. **netlify/functions/login.ts** (2KB)\n- **Endpoint**: POST /api/login\n- **Input**: email, password\n- **Process**:\n  1. Validates required fields\n  2. Queries members table by email\n  3. Hashes password attempt with stored salt\n  4. Compares with stored hash\n  5. Creates 30-day session token\n  6. Returns user (id, name, email) and token\n- **Error Handling**: 400 (missing fields), 401 (invalid credentials), 500 (server error)\n\n#### 10. **netlify/functions/signup.ts** (2.4KB)\n- **Endpoint**: POST /api/signup\n- **Input**: name, email, password\n- **Process**:\n  1. Validates all required fields\n  2. Checks password minimum length (8 chars)\n  3. Checks for existing email (409 conflict)\n  4. Generates salt and hashes password\n  5. Creates member with admin role\n  6. Creates default workspace if none exists\n  7. Creates 30-day session token\n  8. Returns user (id, name, email) and token\n- **Error Handling**: 400 (validation), 409 (duplicate email), 500 (server error)\n\n#### 11. **netlify/functions/me.ts** (1.2KB)\n- **Endpoint**: GET /api/me\n- **Auth**: Bearer token validation\n- **Process**:\n  1. Validates Authorization header format\n  2. Checks session exists and hasn't expired\n  3. Joins with members table\n  4. Returns current user info\n- **Error Handling**: 401 (unauthorized), 405 (method not allowed), 500 (server error)\n\n#### 12. **CSS Files** (LoginForm.css, SignUpForm.css, Login.css, SignUp.css)\n- **Design System**: CSS custom properties for colors\n  - --color-bg, --color-bg-surface\n  - --color-text-primary, --color-text-secondary, --color-text-tertiary\n  - --color-border, --color-accent\n- **Components**: Form fields, buttons, error messages\n- **States**: Focus, disabled, error states with smooth transitions (150ms)\n- **Responsive**: Mobile breakpoints (max-width: 640px)\n\n### Current Implementation Status\n**Phase**: Authentication Foundation\n- 2 pages: Login, SignUp\n- 2 form components: LoginForm, SignUpForm\n- 4 Netlify functions: login, signup, me, db helper\n- Redux authentication slice with async thunks\n- Session token storage in localStorage\n- Default workspace creation on signup\n\n### Missing Components (Per AppSpec)\n**To be implemented**:\n- Sidebar navigation component with collapsible sections\n- My Issues page and issue list components\n- Inbox page with notifications\n- Team Issues page with grouping/filtering/bulk actions\n- Issue Detail page with activity/comments tabs\n- Create Issue modal\n- Cycle management pages\n- Projects and Project Detail pages\n- Members, Teams, Labels management pages\n- Settings pages\n- Keyboard shortcut handler\n- Issue status/priority selectors and badges\n- User avatar component\n- Various utility components (dropdowns, modals, etc.)\n\n### Technology Stack (Per AGENTS.md)\n- **Frontend**: React 18, TypeScript (strict mode), Redux\n- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui\n- **Build**: Vite\n- **Backend**: Netlify Functions\n- **Database**: Postgres (Neon)\n- **File Storage**: UploadThing\n\n### Styling\n- Dark mode by default: `#0f1117` background, `#1a1d24` surfaces\n- Primary accent: `#5e6ad2` (Linear's purple-blue)\n- Uses CSS custom properties for theming\n- 150ms transitions on interactive elements\n- Compact but readable spacing\n\n### Database Structure (Inferred from Functions)\nTables referenced:\n- `members`: id, name, email, password_hash, password_salt, role\n- `sessions`: token, member_id, expires_at\n- `workspaces`: id, name\n\n---\n\n**Absolute File Paths Summary**:\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/AppSpec.md`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/LoginForm.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/SignUpForm.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Login.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/SignUp.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/authSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/db.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/login.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/signup.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/me.ts`"}],"totalDurationMs":103406,"totalTokens":45233,"totalToolUseCount":36,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":678,"cache_read_input_tokens":42109,"output_tokens":2446,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":678},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
